flowchart TD
    START([对局开始]) --> ROLL{随机判断<br/>random < pressure_robot_rate?}
    
    ROLL -->|是| PRESSURE[启用紧咬模式]
    ROLL -->|否| NORMAL[使用原有机器人逻辑]
    
    PRESSURE --> INIT[随机生成达标分数<br/>qualify_score]
    
    INIT --> LOOP[/每次加分检查点/]
    
    LOOP --> CALC[计算目标分数<br/>target = player_score - 随机分差]
    CALC --> COMPARE{target > bot_score?}
    
    COMPARE -->|是| UPDATE[bot_score = target<br/>机器人追分]
    COMPARE -->|否| KEEP[bot_score不变<br/>只涨不跌]
    
    UPDATE --> ENDCHECK{对局结束?}
    KEEP --> ENDCHECK
    
    ENDCHECK -->|否| LOOP
    ENDCHECK -->|是| QUALIFY{player_score >= qualify_score?}
    
    QUALIFY -->|是 玩家达标| WIN[玩家获胜<br/>机器人少加分]
    QUALIFY -->|否 未达标| LOSE[机器人获胜<br/>最后反超]
    
    WIN --> END([对局结束])
    LOSE --> END
    NORMAL --> END

    style PRESSURE fill:#4CAF50,color:white
    style WIN fill:#2196F3,color:white
    style LOSE fill:#f44336,color:white
    style QUALIFY fill:#FF9800,color:white
